						"a": "In commercial applications, DROS stands for **Deterministic Runtime Operating System**. This reflects our ultimate demand for AI systems: transforming the probabilistic behavior of black-box LLMs into highly predictable, deterministic execution.\n\nThis naming actually originates from our core philosophy—**Dharma Reasoning Operation System**. This is a profound technological easter egg, representing the original intention of DROS: even when dealing with philosophical doctrines as deep and dense as the Tripitaka (Buddhist canon), the system ensures the AI strictly adheres to the discipline (security contracts) without generating any hallucinations or logical drift. Today, this system has evolved into a **minimalist microkernel semantic runtime** designed specifically for the Agentic AI era, fundamentally solving generative AI's hallucinations and Prompt Injection issues through 'Physical-layer Vajra Discipline'."
